      "title": "EazeStrips™ - Instant Nasal Strips for Better Breathing.",
      "body_html": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>\"My nose was broken several times and I not only feel constant congestion in one of the nostrils, but also snore horribly. This nasal strip thing really helps to breathe more freely and snore less.\" </strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span> - Dean V. <br><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">✅</span> Verified Buyer</strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Consistent airflow</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> plays a key role in <b>restful sleep</b> and daily comfort. <b>Nasal congestion</b> and <b>allergies</b> can make <b>breathing feel restricted</b>, leading to interrupted rest and reduced performance. This ongoing challenge can create frustration and discomfort, making it harder to feel refreshed and energized.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img alt=\"Starter kit for nose hair removal with a man sleeping in the background\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/2259/3867/files/S9c5de860dfee4ec49b5811833ccd6ec7R.webp?v=1762783495\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">EazeStrips™ Nasal Strips Optimal Airflow Technology</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> provides a gentle, non-invasive way to support <b>easier breathing</b>. Designed to gently widen nasal passages, these innovative devices help promote clearer, more comfortable <b>airflow</b> throughout the day and night. The result is a soothing, refreshing experience that encourages greater relaxation and well-being.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">REASONS WHY EAZESTRIPS™ NASAL STRIPS WILL CHANGE YOUR LIFE</span></b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> <b>Improved Airflow:</b> Featuring a flexible, expanding design, this <b>nasal strip</b> device helps open nasal passages for smoother, more comfortable <b>breathing</b>. EazeStrips™ supports clearer airflow, <b>reducing stuffiness</b> and enhancing respiratory function.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img alt=\"Nasal dilator starter kit with packaging featuring a man's face and product images.\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/2259/3867/files/S5cc66becd8004b8aad525288f5cf7577c.webp?v=1762783495\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> <b>Clearer Breathing:</b> Designed to help relieve <b>nasal congestion</b> from allergies, colds, and other factors, this device promotes better airflow. EazeStrips™ supports <b>easier breathing</b> and overall well-being, fostering a renewed sense of ease.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> <b>Quieter Nights:</b> EazeStrips™ is engineered to improve airflow and reduce airway obstruction, helping to <b>minimize snoring</b>. This enhanced nasal breathing support promotes <b>uninterrupted sleep</b> for more restful and peaceful nights.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img alt=\"Three packs of adhesive patches on a white background\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/2259/3867/files/S1a64f3e67d3d49ce91600989a474753cc.webp?v=1762783496\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> <b>Deeper, Restorative Sleep:</b> Designed to create an optimal sleeping environment, this <b>nasal strip</b> device helps promote <b>deeper, more refreshing rest</b>. EazeStrips™ supports overall health and <b>reduces daytime fatigue</b>, leaving one feeling recharged.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> <b>Enhanced Athletic Performance:</b> EazeStrips™ nasal strip helps improve airflow during exercise, <b>boosting oxygen intake</b> and reducing breathing effort. This increased efficiency supports longer, more intense workouts, promoting confidence and endurance.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img alt=\"Nose strip starter kit with packaging and strips on a white background\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/2259/3867/files/S0cfc6bb165204d558e9800019fdeb4a3h.webp?v=1762783496\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> <b>All-Day Comfort:</b> Designed for a <b>lightweight, discreet fit</b>, this nasal strip device remains virtually unnoticeable while in use. EazeStrips™ supports effortless wear, providing subtle support and renewed confidence throughout the day.</span></p>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\"><br></div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">How to Use</span></b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Start by washing hands to ensure cleanliness before handling EazeStrips™. Attach the adhesive tab, choose the right band size, and gently insert it onto the <b>nasal cavity</b>. Adjust the fit to be snug but comfortable, avoiding any excessive pressure.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img alt=\"Pack of 10 adhesive patches on a white background\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/2259/3867/files/Sb03c390a71dd4035a448d17cf2384795R.webp?v=1762783496\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Take slow, deep breaths to enjoy clear and unobstructed <b>airflow</b>. For optimal hygiene and performance, we recommend replacing the adhesive tabs daily after use. However, you may choose to adjust this based on personal preference. The 15-day and 30-day supplies are provided to ensure consistent use throughout the month. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Experience the full benefits of EazeStrips™ by incorporating it into your daily routine. After each use, simply clean, dry, and store it in a neat, hygienic place for continued top performance!</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img alt=\"Product starter kit with a man wearing nose stickers and an inset showing the product details.\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/2259/3867/files/S26e689ba730d4ad38fa27a1d0c5318adS.webp?v=1762783496\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\"><br></div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Difficulty <b>breathing</b> can be a daily challenge when <b>nasal congestion</b> disrupts sleep, physical activity, and overall comfort. Lingering congestion may lead to restless nights and lower energy levels throughout the day. Studies suggest that nearly <b>40% of adults experience sleep disturbances due to nasal congestion</b>, highlighting the need for natural relief.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">EazeStrips™ nasal strips</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> offer a simple way to support <b>clear breathing</b> without medication. This innovative device is designed to promote airflow and encourage <b>deeper, more restful sleep</b>. Adding EazeStrips™ to a daily routine may contribute to <b>improved comfort</b>, renewed energy, and <b>easier breathing</b>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img alt=\"Hair transplant starter kit with packaging and application materials on a white background\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/2259/3867/files/S2e186a3438244eecb7a4ecceb7b7111fM.webp?v=1762783495\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Product Specifications</span></b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">\n<b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Colors:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> Black, White</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">\n<b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Quantity:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> 30 pcs of adhesive tabs</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">\n<b><span style=\"font-siz